exports[`renderTemplate > renders cancellation_refund to a stable customer mail 1`] = `
{
  "html": "<h1>We’ve cancelled this order</h1><p>Any payment you made is being refunded to the card you paid with.</p><p>Refunds usually land within 5–7 working days.</p><table role="presentation"><tr><th align="left">Order</th><td>ord_01K0SNAPSHOT00000000000001</td></tr><tr><th align="left">Refund</th><td>₹2,499.00</td></tr></table><p><a href="https://printforge.test/orders/ord_01K0SNAPSHOT00000000000001">View your order</a></p><p>Questions? Reply to this email and a person will answer.</p><p>PrintForge — printed to order in India.</p>",
  "subject": "Your PrintForge order was cancelled (ord_01K0SNAPSHOT00000000000001)",
  "text": "We’ve cancelled this order

Any payment you made is being refunded to the card you paid with.
Refunds usually land within 5–7 working days.

Order: ord_01K0SNAPSHOT00000000000001
Refund: ₹2,499.00

View your order: https://printforge.test/orders/ord_01K0SNAPSHOT00000000000001

Questions? Reply to this email and a person will answer.
PrintForge — printed to order in India.",
}
`;

